From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Solomon <47696354+OliverSolomon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:35:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Host controls: comments, Share, the File menu and
 switches for each surface

New Comment asks the host to compose (no empty comment, the pane never
opens, balloon clicks go to the host), Share can go to the host, the File
menu can be arranged item by item (each export format too), and the host can
hide the context menu, rulers, Navigation pane, presence, Share, the mode
switch, the Comments button, zoom and the page-view buttons.
---
